# Purpose: Keep local build, dependency, secret, and runtime files out of git.
# Input/Output: Git reads this file while deciding what to track.
# Invariants: Never commit real .env files, database files, or generated node_modules.
# Debugging: Run `git status --ignored` when a file is unexpectedly hidden.

node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
.DS_Store
.vite/
.turbo/
apps/api/prisma/dev.db
*.tsbuildinfo
